91495ed45a1859c274c0f05ede5ccd281557c6992" "q-34384/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-34384" :question/id #uuid "7e020e6a-b449-5e4a-a844-714301abab08" :question/math-academy-id "q-34384" :question/problem "The matrix $A$ and vectors ${b}_{1}$, ${b}_{2}$, ${b}_{3}$ are given below. Which of the vectors lie in $\\text{Null}(A)?$\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -10 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A vector $b$ lies in $\\text{Null}(A)$ if $Ab=0.$ So, we need to compute the product of $A$ and each of the given vectors and check whether it is equal to $0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A{b}_{1} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -10 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 90\\end{aligned}]\\ne 0\\,\\times  \\\\ A{b}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -10 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-59 \\\\ 118 \\\\ -33\\end{aligned}]\\ne 0\\,\\times  \\\\ A{b}_{3} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -10 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 180\\end{aligned}]\\ne 0\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, none of the vector lies in $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-34384/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e3c3466c-dfb0-5b5f-b556-ce57a1d78519"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-34384"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-111112/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "a0c0a395-bd55-57e3-85d4-ab60cee68355" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [