\end{aligned}].$ Find the value of $k$ such that $b\\in \\text{Null}(A).$" :question/worked-solution "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}k \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2k-8 \\\\ k+4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-2k-8=0 \\\\ k+4=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for each of these equations, we obtain $k=-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-34947/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9171c6fb-ad0b-538f-b982-a2502a20e253"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-34947"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-111109/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "e9548d61-cf9a-5d1d-9331-ad7ec21d7f15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111109/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "3ef9699f-7560-56eb-9907-3ffd142c7e7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111109/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "2865b31b-8b43-5cf5-ad04-3c50b7776819" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111109/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "497168b6-727c-54a0-937c-371bc2d17063" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111109/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "835ea043-16c1-5112-ad07-aa25afe78233" :answer/type 